{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Deterministic Context-Free Language.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Deterministic Context-Free Language.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"deterministic context free language deterministic context free language","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Deterministic Context-Free Language.md","fileName":"Deterministic Context-Free Language.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Deterministic Context-Free Language","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-16 22:54\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Context-Free Languages and Parsing]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Context-Free Languages and Parsing","Pushdown Automaton","LL(1) Parsing","LR(1) Parsing","FoundationsOfComputation_2.3.2.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Deterministic Context-Free Language.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Deterministic Context-Free Language.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"deterministic context free language deterministic context free language","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Deterministic Context-Free Language.md","fileName":"Deterministic Context-Free Language.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Deterministic Context-Free Language","heading":"Deterministic Context-Free Language","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A deterministic context-free language L is one for which a deterministic [[Pushdown Automaton]] accepts the strings of L followed by a distinct end marker. The marker lets the machine distinguish an actual end of input from a point where more symbols might still arrive.\n\nNondeterminism adds genuine recognition power to pushdown automata, so some context-free languages are not deterministic context-free. Deterministic context-free languages support efficient parsing methods such as [[LL(1) Parsing]] and [[LR(1) Parsing]].","tags":["b